{"project":{"slug":"smoke3","name":"Bookshop (smoke)","description":"Demo project smoke3","trunkRepo":"smoke3--trunk","createdAt":1791106449842,"public":true},"agents":[{"id":"sxlyywetx817","callsign":"SMOKE-A","kind":"other","model":"scripted","color":"#4fd1c5","joinedAt":1791106455427,"lastSeenAt":1791106480902},{"id":"ghnltuxw6ltu","callsign":"SMOKE-B","kind":"other","model":"scripted","color":"#f6ad55","joinedAt":1791106455523,"lastSeenAt":1791106463728},{"id":"sdqs9tf70fj1","callsign":"SMOKE-C","kind":"other","model":"scripted","color":"#9f7aea","joinedAt":1791106466340,"lastSeenAt":1791106474147},{"id":"x92e9hqxviz5","callsign":"SMOKE-D","kind":"other","model":"scripted","color":"#68d391","joinedAt":1791106466434,"lastSeenAt":1791106479329}],"intents":[{"id":"qalvvq8t2cjz","seq":1,"title":"Make catalog search case-insensitive and match authors","body":"search(catalog, query) only matches titles case-sensitively. Make it case-insensitive and also match the author name. Keep result order stable (catalog order). Add tests.","priority":5,"status":"open","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":null,"landedCommit":null,"dependsOn":[]},{"id":"9si8dxrnv1xx","seq":2,"title":"Merge duplicate ISBNs in Cart.add","body":"Adding the same ISBN twice should increase the quantity of the existing line instead of pushing a second line. Add a test that cart.lines has one line with qty 3 after add('x', 1) and add('x', 2).","priority":5,"status":"landed","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":"i72losec0dd1","landedCommit":"29442be4d2edda8a4070df8b829689af22d703d3","dependsOn":[]},{"id":"9ido2vhi2pgj","seq":3,"title":"Support percentage coupon codes","body":"applyCoupon should accept codes of the form SAVE<n> (e.g. SAVE10, SAVE25) meaning n percent off, rounded to the nearest cent, with n between 1 and 50. Unknown codes still change nothing; WELCOME5 keeps working. Add tests.","priority":4,"status":"open","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":null,"landedCommit":null,"dependsOn":[]},{"id":"un6w88h6lf10","seq":4,"title":"Free shipping on orders over $50","body":"Add shippingFor(cart, catalog, subtotalCents) in src/shipping.js that returns 0 when the subtotal is at least 5000 cents and shippingCost(parcelWeight(...)) otherwise. Add tests.","priority":4,"status":"open","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":null,"landedCommit":null,"dependsOn":[]},{"id":"rbnnhucvurk1","seq":5,"title":"Bulk discount: 10% off 3+ copies of the same book","body":"In subtotal(), a line with qty >= 3 gets 10% off that line (rounded to the nearest cent). Add tests.","priority":4,"status":"landed","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":"qe1fucb8i88r","landedCommit":"3c7e163f0d78b7203306136ac3c37d89175261f5","dependsOn":[]},{"id":"b3lyvwf6di5o","seq":6,"title":"Format EUR and JPY correctly","body":"formatMoney should render EUR as '€12.34' and JPY with no decimals as '¥1234' (JPY amounts are whole yen, given in 'cents' = yen). Other currencies keep the current format. Add tests.","priority":3,"status":"open","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":null,"landedCommit":null,"dependsOn":[]},{"id":"ym8ml07bs1z9","seq":7,"title":"Add Cart.setQuantity and Cart.isEmpty","body":"setQuantity(isbn, qty) sets the quantity of a line (qty 0 removes it; negative throws). isEmpty() returns true when there are no lines. Add tests.","priority":3,"status":"landed","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":"sueeektca7i1","landedCommit":"fdd6636f8a458f50a6335291707cae525cb9a61d","dependsOn":[]},{"id":"379okzwi5buz","seq":8,"title":"Per-region sales tax table","body":"Replace the hard-coded CA rate in tax() with a TAX_RATES table: CA 7.25%, NY 4%, TX 6.25%, WA 6.5%, OR 0%. Unknown regions are 0. Export TAX_RATES. Add tests.","priority":3,"status":"open","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":null,"landedCommit":null,"dependsOn":[]},{"id":"j27d5v1ifq74","seq":9,"title":"Show tax and discount lines on receipts","body":"renderReceipt(cart, catalog, totalCents, details = {}) should print 'DISCOUNT -$x.xx' when details.discountCents > 0 and 'TAX $x.xx' when details.taxCents > 0, before the TOTAL line. Existing callers keep working. Add tests.","priority":2,"status":"open","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":null,"landedCommit":null,"dependsOn":[]},{"id":"aix2b6mfjzik","seq":10,"title":"Validate ISBN-13 checksums","body":"Add validateIsbn13(isbn) to src/catalog.js returning true only for 13-digit strings with a valid ISBN-13 check digit. createCatalog should throw on an invalid ISBN. Add tests (all SAMPLE_BOOKS are valid).","priority":2,"status":"open","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":null,"landedCommit":null,"dependsOn":[]},{"id":"cty4iksevocd","seq":11,"title":"International shipping zones","body":"shippingCost(weightGrams, zone = 'domestic') should add a surcharge for zone 'intl' of 1500 cents and for 'ca-mx' of 600 cents. Domestic prices are unchanged. Add tests.","priority":2,"status":"open","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":null,"landedCommit":null,"dependsOn":[]},{"id":"rka2inql5t56","seq":12,"title":"Reserve inventory when checking out","body":"Add checkout(cart, inventory) in src/inventory.js that takes every cart line from inventory atomically: if any line is short, nothing is taken and it throws an error naming the ISBN. Add tests.","priority":2,"status":"open","labels":[],"createdBy":"operator","createdAt":1791106455207,"flightId":null,"landedCommit":null,"dependsOn":[]},{"id":"5rgwpl6brclj","seq":13,"title":"Gift wrapping option","body":"total(cart, catalog, opts) accepts opts.giftWrap = true which adds 399 cents per book (per unit, not per line) before tax. Add tests.","priority"